# Check out text as LF on every platform (Windows runners default to core.autocrlf=true).
# Fixtures are compared byte-for-byte or hashed into native documents (e.g. the STEP blob
# in examples/imported_step_hole.f420.json), so CRLF conversion breaks tests. docs/CI.md.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Mesh and archive formats: never convert (ASCII STL included, to keep fixtures byte-exact).
*.stl binary
*.3mf binary
*.png binary
